<title>USA: American Int unit to operate in Uruguay.</title>
<headline>American Int unit to operate in Uruguay.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>American International Group Inc said Wednesday its subsidiary American Life Insurance Co received a license to operate in Uruguay.</p>
<p>American Life's wholly-owned subsidiary ALICO Compania de Seguros de Vida SA in Montevideo initially will sell group life insurance and personal accident insurance through brokers and as an agency, a statement said.</p>
</text>
